hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1657","###\n Narrated to us by Mu'ammar bin Hisham and Ziyad bin Ayyub, who said: Isma'il narrated to us; Khalid Al-Hadda' narrated to us. Mu'ammar added: Khalid Al-Hadda' narrated to us from Abu Qilabah, from Abu Al-Malih, who said: \I went out on a dark night to the mosque to pray the Isha prayer. When I returned"," I knocked on the door. My father asked"," 'Who is this?' They replied","
"
